# Copilot Instructions

Use this file as the source of truth for the Predator Detection Project.

Assume all hardware and software details below are current unless otherwise stated.

When providing advice:

- Prefer Raspberry Pi OS Bookworm commands.
- Prefer low-cost solutions.
- Existing remote access is via Tailscale and ConnectBot on Android.
- Motion detection currently uses OpenCV.
- Camera interface uses Picamera2.
- Future species classification will use YOLO.
- Outdoor deployment uses a weatherproof enclosure with mains power from the house.
- Preserve existing working functionality whenever suggesting changes.
- Prioritise reliability over complexity.
- Provide copy-pasteable commands where possible.

