## Outdoor Enclosure

Current Prototype:

```text
re:fresh by Boost glass food container
```

Construction:

- Glass base
- Sealing lid
- Locking clips
- Existing vent hole suitable for cable routing

Advantages:

- Low cost
- Readily available
- Reasonably weather resistant
- Transparent viewing surface
- Suitable for prototype deployment

Deployment Notes:

- Mount under eave or sheltered location
- Use silica gel packets
- Seal cable entry with silicone
- Position camera close to viewing surface
- Run power from house via extension lead

